      "side": 1,
      "message": "Which is probably why the Bazel runfiles library was never (a far as I can tell) released, because it doesn\u0027t seem to be a good idea. Obviously Bazel\u0027s test runner should just pass the location of the `data` directory to the test executable... but they don\u0027t seem to want to do that for some reason.",
